:: Shopping Day 1c [unfinished] {"position":"3975,2300","size":"100,100"}
{=

(metadata:
"currency", "rial",
"title", "The Spices and Reagents Floor",
"cardDesc", "Most things of the Earth carries a spark of magic. Most things of the Earth are sold here.",
"parent", "S: Shopping Day 1",
"devNote", [Might need to review the itemList. Does the market truly sells every ingredient?],
)

<!--Market setup-->
<!--item list-->
(set: _itemList to (a:))
(for: each _itemDM, ...(passages: where its name contains "item."))[{
    (if: _itemDM's name contains "item.")[{
        (if: _itemDM's key contains "ingredient")[(set: _itemList to it + (a: (trimmed: "item.", _itemDM's name)))]
    }]
}]
<!--buy factor-->
(set: _buyFactors to (passage: "table.marketPriceMod")'s universalBuy)
<!--sell factor-->
(set: _sellFactors to ($funcMarketMergeFactors: _buyFactors, (passage: "table.marketPriceMod")'s universalSell))
<!--define base mods-->
(set: _baseBuyMod to 1.2)
(set: _baseSellMod to .5)
<!--end of market setup-->

$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[

    (css: "font-size: 70%")[
        $cssColumnChild[(link: "⇦ Never mind.")[(goto: (passage:)'s parent)]]
     ]

	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage: "S: Shopping Day 1")'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s cardDesc)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[

Wandering the many floors under the Grand Exchange's dome, you feel a distant kinship to the merchants who harp on about the value of their spices, herbs, oils, and so on.
<br>
They might tell you that so-and-so root goes excellently into a certain soup, or one brand of grease is better for a wagon's joint than another. But the value they hold most dear is a fundamental and fungible one: rial.
<br>
And as a magus who is trained to see the elemental value in everything - for all is made up of the same stuff - you, too, see these stalls teeming with raw, untapped energy.
<br>
All of it can be yours, if you have the rial.
<br>


]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent 1-->

---

$cssColumnParent[
$cssColumnChild[
<!--Readout-->
$cssDesc[($funcMarketReadoutFull: _baseBuyMod, _baseSellMod, _itemList, _buyFactors, _sellFactors)]
<!--end of readout-->
]<!--end child, begin another-->

$cssColumnChild[
<!--main buy/sell menu-->
<ol>
($funcMarketMain: _baseBuyMod, _baseSellMod, (passage:)'s currency, _itemList, _buyFactors, _sellFactors, 1)
<br>
Or...
<br>
<li>(link: "Never mind.")[(goto: (passage:)'s parent)]</li>
</ol>
<!--end of main buy/sell menu-->

]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent 2-->